sequenceDiagram
accTitle: Same hostname, new database connection
accDescr: Maintenance promotes the standby, changes DNS mapping and requires the client to reconnect using the unchanged endpoint name.
participant A as Application
participant D as Endpoint DNS
participant P as Primary AZ A
participant S as Standby AZ B
A->>D: Resolve db.example.rds.amazonaws.com
D-->>A: Primary address
A->>P: Database connection
Note over P,S: Maintenance triggers standby promotion
P--xA: Existing connection ends
S->>D: RDS changes endpoint mapping
A->>D: Resolve same hostname again
D-->>A: Promoted standby address
A->>S: New database connection
